# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# ArticleFlux runs completely without this. The only thing it unlocks is the Smart+
# voice (plan.md A31, §10.7) — the browser's own speech synthesiser reads
# articles for free, offline, with no key at all, and that is the default.
#
# Smart+ sends the text of the article being read to OpenAI. It is off per user
# until they turn it on, AND the server refuses to egress at all without this
# key, so an instance that never sets it cannot send anything anywhere.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
